  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop or crush garlic. In a medium saucepan, melt 1/2 butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Cook 1/2 garlic until fragrant, 1-2 mins. Add basmati rice, the water and a generous pinch of salt and bring to the boil. Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid. Cook for 10 mins, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and the water is absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61a837ce0c1c3561f95a3689/step-4b6d3ba2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, drain sweetcorn.\n• Heat a large frying pan over high heat. Cook corn until lightly browned, 4-5 mins. Transfer to a bowl.\n• Finely chop brown onion. Grate carrot. Roughly chop tomato. Drain and rinse lentils.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61a837ce0c1c3561f95a3689/step-3fa0e7fa.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook onion and carrot, stirring, until softened, 4-5 min.\n• Stir in remaining garlic, lentils and Mexican seasoning, until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Stir in passata, brown sugar, vegetable stock, remaining butter and a splash of water.\n• Simmer until slightly reduced, 1-2 minutes. Season.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61a837ce0c1c3561f95a3689/step-43173def.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To corn, add tomato and a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season and toss.\n• Divide rice between bowls.\n• Top with Mexican lentils, salsa and cheese.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61a837ce0c1c3561f95a3689/step-d4996494.jpg"
    }
  ]
